{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Three times in the Masorah:</b> דין defective and two plene — פדות שלח לעמו and והרבה עמו פדות. For this was not a complete פדות (redemption) but because of the ערוב (mixture). But when they went out of Egypt it was complete, and this is פדות שלח לעמו, and in the future והרבה עמו פדות, and it will be a complete redemption:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:15.292337805Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}